{"seq":3,"slug":"audit-readiness-cert","title":"审计就绪与认证支撑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-audit-log-platform/compliance-alert/audit-readiness-cert","wordCount":3816,"readingTime":16,"html":"<h1 id=\"审计就绪与认证支撑\">审计就绪与认证支撑</h1><p>认证现场最常见的一种失分方式是：审计师问「请出示 2025 年 3 月到 5 月的管理员权限变更记录」，团队回答「请给我们两周时间整理」。这个回答在认证语境下几乎是致命的——它传递的信息是：证据存在，但你的体系不能常态地提供它。审计师随后写下的发现不是「证据缺失」，而是「控制未能持续有效运行」，后者的严重性高得多。</p>\n<p>这个差别值得仔细琢磨。控制框架关心的是「控制是否被设计并持续运行」，而不是「某个时间点上能不能临时攒出证据」。因此审计就绪（audit readiness）不是每年认证前一两个月的突击准备，而是<strong>审计管道作为一个副产品持续产出的能力</strong>。这个转变是本章的主题，也是整个 hub 的收束：前几章建立的采集、存储、查询、告警全部是手段，持续可证明才是目的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-控制目标到审计事件的映射\">核心概念：控制目标到审计事件的映射</h2><h3 id=\"映射把认证从写文档变成查数据\">映射把认证从写文档变成查数据</h3><p>认证工作从控制框架出发。SOC 2 的信任服务准则、ISO 27001 的附录 A 控制项，都是「控制目标」的清单：变更管理、访问控制、职责分离、日志与监控、事件响应、数据保留等。审计团队的第一项准备工作是把这些控制目标逐条映射到<strong>具体的审计事件</strong>上——即「如果这条控制有效运行，它会在审计数据里留下什么痕迹」。</p>\n<p>映射的价值在于它把认证从「写文档」变成了「查数据」。下面是一个映射的样例结构（具体控制编号以组织适用的框架版本为准）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制目标</th>\n<th>期望的审计事件</th>\n<th>可自动化的验证</th>\n<th>常见缺口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>变更管理：生产变更经审批</td>\n<td>审批记录 + 发布操作记录 + 两者关联</td>\n<td>存在无审批关联的发布</td>\n<td>紧急发布未补审批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问控制：权限按需授予</td>\n<td>权限授予事件 + 审批记录 + 定期复核记录</td>\n<td>存在无审批的授予</td>\n<td>授予与审批无关联键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>职责分离：申请人≠审批人</td>\n<td>两个事件的主体不同</td>\n<td>存在同一主体自审</td>\n<td>代批、共享账号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志监控：异常被检测处置</td>\n<td>告警事件 + 处置记录 + 结论</td>\n<td>存在无处置记录的告警</td>\n<td>告警只发不收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件响应：事件被追踪至关闭</td>\n<td>事件创建、动作、关闭记录</td>\n<td>存在长期未关闭事件</td>\n<td>线下处置未回填</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据保留：按策略留存与删除</td>\n<td>保留策略变更 + 到期删除记录</td>\n<td>存在超期未删/未到期即删</td>\n<td>手工删除无记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"控制声明即审计数据上的断言\">控制声明即审计数据上的断言</h3><p>映射做好之后，每一项控制就从「一段描述」变成了「一条可以被查询表达式检验的命题」。这是审计就绪的技术核心：<strong>把控制声明转成审计数据上的断言</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"控制项到证据的可执行映射\">控制项到证据的可执行映射</h3><p>上一节的表描述了映射关系，要让它成为常态产出，映射本身必须是一份可调度执行的配置。下面这份配置把每条控制声明成一个断言查询，并规定它产出证据的形态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;framework&quot;: &quot;SOC2-TSC&quot;,&#10;  &quot;framework_version&quot;: &quot;2026-Q3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;evidence_store&quot;: &quot;audit-evidence-bucket&quot;,&#10;  &quot;checks&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;control_id&quot;: &quot;CC8.1&quot;,&#10;      &quot;control&quot;: &quot;变更管理：生产变更经审批&quot;,&#10;      &quot;assertion&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;query&quot;: &quot;no_unapproved_deployments&quot;,&#10;        &quot;join_key&quot;: &quot;request_id&quot;,&#10;        &quot;window&quot;: &quot;P7D&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;evidence&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;sample_size&quot;: 20,&#10;        &quot;sample_ref&quot;: &quot;audit_event_id + block_seq + checkpoint_seq&quot;,&#10;        &quot;coverage_decl&quot;: &quot;block_seq range + expected vs actual count&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;schedule&quot;: &quot;daily&quot;,&#10;      &quot;on_failure&quot;: { &quot;create_remediation&quot;: true, &quot;owner_role&quot;: &quot;release_manager&quot;, &quot;due_days&quot;: 14 }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;control_id&quot;: &quot;CC6.2&quot;,&#10;      &quot;control&quot;: &quot;访问控制：权限按需授予且经审批&quot;,&#10;      &quot;assertion&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;query&quot;: &quot;permission_grants_without_approval&quot;,&#10;        &quot;join_key&quot;: &quot;request_id&quot;,&#10;        &quot;window&quot;: &quot;P1D&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;evidence&quot;: { &quot;sample_size&quot;: 20, &quot;sample_ref&quot;: &quot;audit_event_id + block_seq + checkpoint_seq&quot; },&#10;      &quot;schedule&quot;: &quot;daily&quot;,&#10;      &quot;on_failure&quot;: { &quot;create_remediation&quot;: true, &quot;owner_role&quot;: &quot;iam_owner&quot;, &quot;due_days&quot;: 7 }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;control_id&quot;: &quot;CC7.2&quot;,&#10;      &quot;control&quot;: &quot;日志监控：异常被检测并处置&quot;,&#10;      &quot;assertion&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;query&quot;: &quot;alerts_without_disposition&quot;,&#10;        &quot;window&quot;: &quot;P7D&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;evidence&quot;: { &quot;sample_size&quot;: 10, &quot;sample_ref&quot;: &quot;alert_id + disposition_event_id&quot; },&#10;      &quot;schedule&quot;: &quot;daily&quot;,&#10;      &quot;on_failure&quot;: { &quot;create_remediation&quot;: true, &quot;owner_role&quot;: &quot;security_oncall&quot;, &quot;due_days&quot;: 3 }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;control_id&quot;: &quot;CC7.4&quot;,&#10;      &quot;control&quot;: &quot;数据保留：按策略留存与删除&quot;,&#10;      &quot;assertion&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;query&quot;: &quot;expired_but_still_readable_objects&quot;,&#10;        &quot;tolerance&quot;: { &quot;max_count&quot;: 0, &quot;grace_hours&quot;: 24 }&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;evidence&quot;: { &quot;sample_size&quot;: 0, &quot;sample_ref&quot;: &quot;policy_change_event_id&quot; },&#10;      &quot;schedule&quot;: &quot;daily&quot;,&#10;      &quot;on_failure&quot;: { &quot;create_remediation&quot;: true, &quot;owner_role&quot;: &quot;platform_owner&quot;, &quot;due_days&quot;: 7 }&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;gap_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;on_missing_pipeline_data&quot;: &quot;emit_evidence_gap&quot;,&#10;    &quot;never_silently_pass&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;mark_coverage_unknown&quot;: true&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;metrics&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;assertion_pass_rate&quot;: { &quot;alert_if_failing_older_than_days&quot;: 30 },&#10;    &quot;evidence_coverage&quot;: { &quot;target&quot;: 0.99, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;block_seq_coverage&quot; },&#10;    &quot;evidence_latency&quot;: { &quot;target_hours&quot;: 24 }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"framework\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SOC2-TSC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"framework_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-Q3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence_store\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"audit-evidence-bucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"checks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"control_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CC8.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"control\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"变更管理：生产变更经审批\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"assertion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no_unapproved_deployments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"join_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"request_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P7D\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"sample_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"sample_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"audit_event_id + block_seq + checkpoint_seq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"coverage_decl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"block_seq range + expected vs actual count\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"schedule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"daily\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"on_failure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"create_remediation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"owner_role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"release_manager\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"due_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"control_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CC6.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"control\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"访问控制：权限按需授予且经审批\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"assertion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"permission_grants_without_approval\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"join_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"request_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P1D\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sample_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sample_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"audit_event_id + block_seq + checkpoint_seq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"schedule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"daily\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"on_failure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"create_remediation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"owner_role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"iam_owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"due_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"control_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CC7.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"control\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"日志监控：异常被检测并处置\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"assertion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"co